# The runtime version is a fingerprint of native inputs; local and EAS builds must agree on it.
# A local Android build rewrites library manifests in place (React Native's Gradle plugin strips
# their `package=` attribute), which EAS's fresh install never sees. A real native dependency
# change still changes that package's package.json, which stays in the fingerprint.
node_modules/**/android/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml
